  "description": "Rule one of harboring a secret crush: never get your hopes up. Especially if your crush is the nicest person you’ve ever seen. Yeon-U’s kind, thoughtful, and gentle—everything that Gyu-Yeong wants his significant other to be. The problem is that Yeon-U’s nice to everyone, not just Gyu-Yeong. Gyu-Yeong knows that he’s not special to Yeon-U, but sometimes he wants to give in to the little voice in his heart. Maybe all of this does mean something, maybe Yeon-U thinks that he’s special, maybe Gyu-Yeong will be allowed to build his hopes up, just this once.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n *Note: Season 2 is rated R19.*",
